  "licensed_claim": "The replicated L11H2/L11H5 promoter-classifier core depends on the native association between its attention weights and source value vectors. Permuting V across 40 fixed genomic token positions while leaving Q, K, and post-softmax attention probabilities native causes a target-specific promoter-margin loss that replicates against every equal-size layer-11 null pair.",
  "mechanistic_model": "Together with D6's null query transfer, D7 narrows the late pair to a value/source-state payload-routing role: native attention probabilities must remain aligned with their value vectors. The represented feature and causal source positions are unresolved.",
